	<span class="d-block section-heading color-primary text-capitalize">Chheda Greens</span>
	<span class="d-block section-heading-sub color-primary text-capitalize">At Mira Road East</span>
	
				<p>Chheda Greens Avighna comprises of 29 floors with Two Wings A & B Wing and features 3 level parking and an E-Deck level. The project offers various types of apartments including 1 BHK, 2 BHK, and limited 2.5 BHK options. The apartments also have the option for combined units such as 1+1 BHK Jodi and 2+1 BHK Jodi. The project includes ultra-modern amenities such as a lavish lobby and modular kitchen.
 </p>
 <p>In addition to the amenities previously mentioned, Chheda Greens Mira Road also offers a variety of other features and facilities for residents to enjoy.</p>
